{
  "title": "Verisav Semantic Vocabularies: DPP, RMA, WTY",
  "description": "Open RDF/OWL vocabularies for EU Digital Product Passports (ESPR 2024/1781), after-sales (RMA), and machine-readable warranties (WTY). DPP v1.5.2 aligns with JRC methodology, GS1 Digital Link, UNTP, EPCIS, CIRPASS-2, W3C Verifiable Credentials and EU Business Wallet patterns. Validated on LOV, persistent URIs via W3ID.",
